def rel_fro(X, Y): return float(np.linalg.norm(X-Y,'fro')/np.linalg.norm(Y,'fro'))
```

Rayleigh:
```python
def rayleigh(r, R, j, op, M=None):
    v = np.sin(np.pi*j*r[1:-1]/R)
    if M is None: return float(v @ (op @ v) / (v @ v))
    return float(v @ (op @ v) / (v @ (M @ v)))
```
